<title>UK: UK Treasury - no proposals to revalue gold reserve.</title>
<headline>UK Treasury - no proposals to revalue gold reserve.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>A spokesman for the UK Treasury said on Friday there were &quot;no proposals&quot; to revalue the country's gold reserves.</p>
<p>He was commenting following news on Thursday that Germany was planning to revalue its gold reserves.</p>
<p>At end of 1996, the UK's gold reserves totalled 717 tonnes valued at $297 per ounce, according to International Monetary Fund statistics.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 8058</p>
